    "title": "Anticipatory Learning for Climate Change Adaptation and Resilience",
    "summary": "This article proposes a methodological framework for anticipatory learning to enhance climate change adaptation and resilience in high-poverty contexts. By integrating resilience thinking with action research and learning, the authors outline a process involving memory, monitoring, scenario planning, and critical reflection to help vulnerable communities navigate climatic uncertainty.",
